## Human gates

The following actions are **irreversible or high-blast-radius** and require
explicit human approval before the loop proceeds. On Prime Agent Desk the Loop
Runtime **pauses** the loop at each gate, queues a pending-approval item, and
waits — nothing irreversible runs unattended.

| # | Gate | Trigger condition | Who approves |
|---|------|-------------------|--------------|
| G1 | Pre-run sign-off | Before the very first live run on real data | Student |
| G2 | Verifier anomaly | Verifier returns exit 1 on any iteration | Student |
| G3 | Apply outside `work/` | Before writing/moving anything outside the loop's `work/` scratch dir | Student |
| G4 | Send / publish | Before sending a message, email, notification, or publishing externally | Student |
| G5 | Spend / bill | Before any action that incurs external cost (paid API, cloud resource) | Student |
| G6 | Delete / overwrite | Before deleting files or overwriting data that cannot be recovered | Student |

